WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.117
Let's connect a Bluesky

00:00:02.117 --> 00:00:03.537
account to Recatch.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.599
Step one. Create your

00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:07.778
account at recatch.app.

00:00:07.848 --> 00:00:09.686
On the Create your workspace

00:00:09.686 --> 00:00:11.588
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:11.588 --> 00:00:13.163
email, and a password of

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:14.856
at least 8 characters.

00:00:14.926 --> 00:00:16.409
Then click Create account.

00:00:16.709 --> 00:00:17.722
Step two. You land

00:00:17.722 --> 00:00:19.267
on the Channels screen.

00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:21.768
Under Connect a channel, click Bluesky.

00:00:21.838 --> 00:00:23.160
If you see Sign in with

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.461
Bluesky, that's the one-click option. To

00:00:25.461 --> 00:00:27.531
paste an app password instead, click

00:00:27.531 --> 00:00:29.391
Use an app password instead.

00:00:29.691 --> 00:00:32.996
Step three. In Bluesky, open Settings,

00:00:32.996 --> 00:00:36.040
then Privacy and security, then App

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.291
passwords, and add one.

00:00:38.361 --> 00:00:40.274
Tick Allow access to your direct

00:00:40.274 --> 00:00:42.737
messages, or Recatch can't read them.

00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:44.473
Never use your main password.

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:46.839
These values are fake examples. Never

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:48.888
share your real app password.

00:00:49.188 --> 00:00:51.125
Step four. Paste your Bluesky

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:53.245
handle and the app password.

00:00:53.545 --> 00:00:55.820
Step five. Click Connect account.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.207
Bluesky doesn't push messages, so

00:00:58.207 --> 00:00:59.915
Recatch checks for new ones

00:00:59.915 --> 00:01:01.303
every few seconds.

00:01:01.373 --> 00:01:03.153
Only messages that arrive after

00:01:03.153 --> 00:01:04.838
you connect are answered.

00:01:05.138 --> 00:01:07.338
That's it. Bluesky is connected.

00:01:07.408 --> 00:01:09.161
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:09.161 --> 00:01:11.226
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:11.226 --> 00:01:12.415
a blank canvas.
